  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ENABLE (Enacting Networks of Activists to Build Legislation Mandated by Criminal Code)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this project, LBHM with  will encourage the drafting of government regulations for the implementation of Criminal Code that respects basic principles and values of human rights. This goal will be achieved through consolidating a solid network between CSOs, academics, vulnerable groups and the general public as well as the drafting recommendations for government regulations. The activities will include consolidation meetings between CSOs, formulation of policy briefs, and dissemination meetings with relevant government officials</narrative>
  </description>
